hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"34","Bismillah buland awaz se parhne ke bare mein. Abbad ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Abbad ibn al-Awwam ne hum se bayan kiya, Sharik se, Salim se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Makkah mein Bismillah al-Rahman al-Rahim buland awaz se parha karte the. Unhon ne kaha: Ahl-e-Makkah Musaylimah ko al-Rahman kehte the, to unhon ne kaha: Muhammad Yamamah ke mabud ko pukarta hai. To Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko hukm diya gaya to Aap ne use poshida kar liya, phir Aap ne wafat tak use kabhi buland awaz se na parha."
"35","Wahb ibn Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid se, Husayn se, Abu Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Tere naam se, Ae Allah likha karte the. Phir jab ye nazil hua: Beshak ye Sulayman ki taraf se hai aur beshak ye Allah ke naam se hai jo Bara Meherban Nihayat Rehem wala hai, to Aap ne Bismillah al-Rahman al-Rahim likha."
"36","Ahmad ibn Muhammad al-Marwazi ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ibn Uyaynah ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) kisi surat ke khatm ko na pehchante the hatta ke Bismillah al-Rahman al-Rahim nazil ho jati. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Is hadith ko musnad bayan kiya gaya hai, aur yehi zyada sahih hai."
